# The root .gitignore's blanket `dist`/`dist/` rules exist to keep
# REGENERABLE build output out of git (tools/check-generated-files.mjs's
# rule 5 documents the same policy for `packages/*/dist/`). This package's
# `dist/` is different: it is the VENDORED, hand-patched published artifact
# of @vscode/markdown-editor@0.0.2-84 (see ../NOTICE and ../PATCHES.md) —
# there is no build step that regenerates it, so it must be tracked like any
# other source file. Re-include it here, scoped to this one package only.
!/dist/
!/dist/**
